            },
            "authorAssociation": "NONE",
            "body": "I'm not entirely sure what you mean by adding `dQ`, but you could try using `dt\"` to delete up to the next quote, `cw` or `dw` to delete words. If you're looking to delete everything inside the quotes and enter insert mode, `ci\"` would work. ",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I'm not entirely sure what you mean by adding <code class=\"notranslate\">dQ</code>, but you could try using <code class=\"notranslate\">dt\"</code> to delete up to the next quote, <code class=\"notranslate\">cw</code> or <code class=\"notranslate\">dw</code> to delete words. If you're looking to delete everything inside the quotes and enter insert mode, <code class=\"notranslate\">ci\"</code> would work.</p>",
            "bodyText": "I'm not entirely sure what you mean by adding dQ, but you could try using dt\" to delete up to the next quote, cw or dw to delete words. If you're looking to delete everything inside the quotes and enter insert mode, ci\" would work.",
